<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH-Bangert rates Baan long-term buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH-Bangert rates Baan long-term buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Baan  Information technology  98.40   Bank Bangert Pontier</p>
<p>COMMENT: (Long-term BUY) We upgrade our EPS estimates for 1997, 1998 and 1999 to NLG 1.50 (1.35), NLG 2.55 (2.20) and NLG 3.70 (3.20) respectively. Although we recognise the impressive valuation of Baan, as well as the strong share performance of the stock in the first four months of the year, we remain very positive about the long term prospects for the company.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E    CF/share</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     0.65    0.65	 94    1.20</p>
<p>    1997		  1.50    1.35	 65    2.05</p>
<p>    1998		  2.55    2.20	 39    3.35</p>
<p>    1999		  3.70    3.20	 26    4.80</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
</text>
